  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "人工智慧物聯網",
    "sub_ename": "ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE OF THINGS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程之目的在讓學生學習嵌入式系統、感測器技術、無線通訊協議、雲端運算等相關知識。課程強調設計、開發及整合物聯網應用，包括物聯網裝置的設計與製作、資料收集與分析、以及應用程式開發。學生透過實作專案，掌握物聯網系統的構建與管理，並學會應用人工智慧、大數據等技術優化物聯網解決方案，培養學生面對物聯網相關挑戰的能力。最終，學生將具備設計、實作智慧物聯網系統的能力，以應對日益普及的智慧化應用需求。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to enable students to learn about embedded systems, sensor technologies, wireless communication protocols, cloud computing, and related knowledge. The course emphasizes the design, development, and integration of IoT applications, including the design and fabrication of IoT devices, data collection and analysis, and application development. Through hands-on projects, students will master the construction and management of IoT systems and learn to apply technologies such as artificial intelligence and big data to optimize IoT solutions, cultivating their ability to address the Internet of Things challenges. Ultimately, students can design and implement AIoT systems to meet the growing demand for intelligent applications.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
